## Protocol: {{ fullstack.tool_name }} (fullstack)

The `{{ fullstack.dir }}/` directory is a single {{ fullstack.language }} component that implements **both** the on-chain validators and the off-chain transaction logic in one build. Its two halves share types directly, so there's no `plutus.json` round-trip between them — but `just build-protocol` still writes `blueprint/plutus.json` so the other components (devnet, formal-methods, infrastructure) can consume it.

```bash
just build-protocol
just test-protocol
```
{%- endif %}
