## Devnet: {{ devnet.tool_name }}

The `{{ devnet.dir }}/` directory runs a local throwaway chain via {{ devnet.tool_name }}. `just test-integration` spins it up, runs an integration smoke test, and tears it down; `just -f {{ devnet.dir }}/Justfile dev` starts a persistent devnet that off-chain components connect to automatically (via `.env`).

